{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13107140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13107140","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1310714001:1":{"text":"二千年前、第一次神魔大戦で女神デューラ様が人間に祝福を与えてくださったおかげで、我々は勝利しました。","source_cn":"据说两千年前的第一次神魔战争中，女神艾雅庇佑了人类，赐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x937C4929CC42A95E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310714002:1":{"text":"戦後、ある女性が氷の上でデューラ様に踊りを捧げ、庇護を授かりました。後に彼女は聖堂から列聖され、遺体は聖堂の地下墓地に安置されています。","source_cn":"在战后，有位年轻女性在冰面上向艾雅献舞，获得了女神的喜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64B097368FEE45E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310714003:0":{"text":"そして、女神様が喜ばれたその氷の舞が、後に祭典のフラワースケートになったのですよ。","source_cn":"后来，这受女神艾雅喜爱的冰之舞，就慢慢演化成为了祭典上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB8EB3EA550D8DDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310714004:1":{"text":"さあ、滑りましょう！もしかしたら、あなたにも女神様の加護が舞い降りるかも！","source_cn":"来吧，来滑冰吧！说不定你也能得到女神的喜爱和庇佑呢！<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93BB1BEE6C9DEB26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祭典办事员":{"text":"祭典のスタッフ","source":"祭典办事员","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}